.TH MINIOS-DEPLOY 1 "September 2026" "MiniOS Installer 3.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
minios-deploy \- command-line interface for the MiniOS installer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B minios-deploy
.RI COMMAND
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B minios-deploy
provides a scriptable command-line frontend for the MiniOS installer backend. It is intended for testing, automation, and recovery sessions where the graphical wizard is not convenient.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list-disks [--json]
List installable disks detected by the installer.
.TP
.B plan DEVICE [--mode MODE] [--filesystem FS] [--placement MODE] [OPTIONS]
Print the partition plan that would be applied to DEVICE.
.TP
.B install DEVICE [OPTIONS]
Run a live or native installation. Without
.B --yes
the command refuses to write to disk. Use
.B --dry-run
to preview commands without making changes.
.SH INSTALL OPTIONS
.TP
.B --mode live|native
Installation mode. Default: live. On live images without the required native
installation contracts, only live is accepted; native mode is hidden and rejected.
.TP
.B --filesystem FS
Root filesystem. Default: ext4. Native mode accepts ext2, ext4, and btrfs.
.TP
.B --placement MODE
Use erase_all, free_space, or alongside_os. Manual partitioning is GUI-only.
.TP
.B --alongside-size MIB
MiniOS capacity to release from the alongside shrink candidate.
.TP
.B --swap-size MIB
Native installation only. Swap size. Default: 0.
.TP
.B --boot-layout LAYOUT
Use auto, bios_mbr, uefi_mbr, or uefi_gpt.
.TP
.B --modules LIST
Comma-separated module names. Required lower layers are included automatically.
.TP
.B --security-profile PROFILE
Use convenient, balanced, or strict. Defaults to convenient for live and
balanced for native installations.
.TP
.B --persistence-mode none|native|dynfilefs|raw|luks
Live installation only. The native persistence choice writes changes directly
to a POSIX-compatible MiniOS partition; it is unrelated to
.B --mode native .
LUKS is listed only when the running initrd advertises crypto support and also
requires a crypto-capable source initrd.
.TP
.B --persistence-size MIB
Live installation only. Container persistence size. Default: 4000 MiB. Raw and
LUKS are limited to 4000 MiB on FAT32; DynFileFS is not.
.TP
.B --download-packages
Native installation only. Allow required package downloads. The CLI default is disabled.
The minios-native-dracut dependency supplies a conventional dracut initramfs
toolchain even when the live image uses livekit-mos. Without downloads,
single-system erase-all can use EXTLINUX on BIOS or the verified live-medium
EFI chain with a minimal native GRUB configuration on UEFI.
.TP
.B --boot-menu LANG
Live installation only. Boot menu language code (e.g. ru_RU) or
.B multilang
(default).
.TP
.B --dry-run
Validate and print planned commands without writing to disk. A dry run cannot
guarantee that the eventual runtime environment will remain unchanged.
.TP
.B --yes
Confirm that the target disk may be erased.
.TP
.B --config-file PATH
Live installation only. Base
.I config.conf
to copy and merge with CLI overrides. When omitted and overrides are set, the live system
.I /etc/live/config.conf
is used as the base if present.
.SH SYSTEM CONFIGURATION
The following options customize the installed system. In live mode they write
the same keys as
.B minios-configurator
into
.IR minios/config.conf ;
in native mode the supported account, locale, timezone, keyboard, target, and
service settings are applied directly. Options marked live-only are rejected
with
.B --mode native .
Boolean options accept
.BR true / false
(also yes/no, on/off, 1/0).
.SS User
.TP
.B --username NAME
.B LIVE_USERNAME
.TP
.B --full-name NAME
.B LIVE_USER_FULLNAME
.TP
.B --user-groups LIST
.B LIVE_USER_DEFAULT_GROUPS
.TP
.B --password PASS
Plain password; stored as
.B LIVE_USER_PASSWORD_CRYPTED
.TP
.B --root-password PASS
Plain password; stored as
.B LIVE_ROOT_PASSWORD_CRYPTED
.PP
The password options expose plaintext to shell history and the process list
while the command is running. Avoid them in shared environments.
.TP
.B --link-user-dirs BOOL
Live installation only.
.B LIVE_LINK_USER_DIRS
.TP
.B --bind-user-dirs BOOL
Live installation only.
.B LIVE_BIND_USER_DIRS
.TP
.B --user-dirs-path PATH
Live installation only.
.B LIVE_USER_DIRS_PATH
.SS System
.TP
.B --noroot BOOL
Live installation only.
.B LIVE_CONFIG_NOROOT
.TP
.B --hostname NAME
.B LIVE_HOSTNAME
.TP
.B --locale / --locales LIST
.B LIVE_LOCALES
.TP
.B --timezone ZONE
.B LIVE_TIMEZONE
.TP
.B --default-target TARGET
.B DEFAULT_TARGET
(graphical, multi-user, rescue, or full unit names)
.TP
.B --enable-services LIST
.B ENABLE_SERVICES
.TP
.B --disable-services LIST
.B DISABLE_SERVICES
.SS Keyboard
.TP
.B --keyboard-model MODEL
.B LIVE_KEYBOARD_MODEL
.TP
.B --keyboard / --keyboard-layouts LIST
.B LIVE_KEYBOARD_LAYOUTS
.TP
.B --keyboard-options OPTS
.B LIVE_KEYBOARD_OPTIONS
.TP
.B --keyboard-variants LIST
.B LIVE_KEYBOARD_VARIANTS
.SS Advanced
The following advanced options are available only with
.B --mode live .
.TP
.B --module-mode simple|merged
.B LIVE_MODULE_MODE
.TP
.B --live-config-cmdline STRING
.B LIVE_CONFIG_CMDLINE
.TP
.B --config-debug BOOL
.B LIVE_CONFIG_DEBUG
.TP
.B --export-logs BOOL
.B EXPORT_LOGS
.SH PLACEMENT MODES
.TP
.B erase_all
Create a new partition table and erase the selected disk.
.TP
.B free_space
Create partitions in suitable unallocated space without shrinking filesystems.
.TP
.B alongside_os
Shrink an eligible unmounted final ext2/ext3/ext4 or NTFS partition.
.SH LIMITATIONS
The CLI does not provide manual partition editing or dedicated network flags.
Manual storage and interactive wired network configuration are available in
the GTK wizard. BIOS on GPT, extended/logical MBR preserve layouts, LVM, RAID,
LUKS native roots, and mapped or nested target storage are unsupported.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
minios-deploy list-disks
minios-deploy plan /dev/sdb --mode native --placement free_space
minios-deploy install /dev/sdb --mode native --placement free_space --yes \\
  --security-profile balanced --download-packages \\
  --username alice --password secret \\
  --hostname workstation --locale ru_RU.UTF-8 \\
  --timezone Europe/Moscow --keyboard us,ru \\
  --keyboard-options grp:alt_shift_toggle \\
  --default-target graphical --enable-services ssh
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR minios-installer (1),
.BR minios-configurator (1),
.BR live-config (7)
